Modifications in this distribution:
- Selected browsing click strokes from three source participants.
- Trimmed the initial two percent of traveled distance and repeated ending positions.
- Excluded strokes shorter than 30 pixels, with fewer than four retained samples,
  with nonpositive duration, or with duration of 5 seconds or more.
- Made coordinates and times relative to each first retained sample.
- Preserved all retained sample times and integer coordinates exactly using a
  BOUN v1 binary delta format with 1/4096-millisecond residuals and Brotli compression.
- Omitted participant identifiers and unrelated records.

